WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.200 line:85%
墨，牵出一线。
Ink draws a line.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.700 line:85%
线，落笔成约。
The line signs a contract.

00:00:04.800 --> 00:00:07.600 line:85%
约，须经权衡。
A contract must be weighed.

00:00:07.700 --> 00:00:10.600 line:85%
以法为经，以智为纬。
Law the warp. Intelligence the weft.

00:00:10.800 --> 00:00:12.300 line:85%
印落，诺成。
A seal falls. A promise holds.

00:00:12.600 --> 00:00:14.900 line:85%
律以载道，智以致远。
Law carries the way. Intelligence goes the distance.
